  "body": "This is because we assign a stream ordering fairly early on, and we block notifying `/sync` streams / replication / etc about later events until the slow event has finished persisting.\r\n\r\nOne mitigation could be to assign a stream ordering as late as possible inside the transaction, to minimise the number of queries that could block future events.",
